@startuml
' AI 原始输出（v3 提示词），未经人工修正
' 保留目的：作为系统性评估依据
left to right direction
actor 运维工程师 as Ops
actor 系统管理员 as Admin
actor 普通用户 as Viewer
actor 网关设备 as GW

rectangle 物联知图平台 {
  usecase "浏览图谱" as UC1
  usecase "查看节点详情" as UC2
  usecase "选择动作" as UC3
  usecase "提交指令" as UC4
  usecase "下发指令" as UC5
  usecase "接收执行结果" as UC6
  usecase "维护设备档案" as UC7
  usecase "配置告警规则" as UC8
}

Ops --> UC1
Ops --> UC3
Ops --> UC4
Admin --> UC7
Admin --> UC8
Viewer --> UC1
GW --> UC6
UC1 ..> UC2 : <<include>>
UC3 ..> UC4 : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC5 ..> UC6 : <<include>>
@enduml
